  "answer": "C",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "At equilibrium $kx_0 = mg$, so $\\dfrac{m}{k} = \\dfrac{x_0}{g}$.\n$$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{x_0}{g}} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{0.04}{\\pi^2}} = 2 \\times 0.2 = 0.4\\ \\text{s}$$",
